@startuml CU06_GestionarAtributos
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DefaultFontColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowFontSize 9
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ActorFontStyle normal
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontSize 10
    ParticipantFontStyle normal
}

title CU6. Gestionar atributos tipados

actor Editor
participant ClassContextMenu <<View>>
participant CollaborationStompController <<Controller>>
participant Atributo <<Model>>

Editor -> ClassContextMenu : 6. AgregarAtributo(classId)
activate ClassContextMenu
ClassContextMenu -> CollaborationStompController : 6.1 SEND /app/diagram/{id}/lock(ACQUIRE, classId)
activate CollaborationStompController
CollaborationStompController --> ClassContextMenu : 6.2 lockConcedido
deactivate CollaborationStompController
ClassContextMenu -> CollaborationStompController : 6.3 SEND /app/diagram/{id}/mutate(ADD_ATTRIBUTE, classId, payload)
activate CollaborationStompController
CollaborationStompController -> Atributo : 6.4 crear(id, nombre, tipo, longitud, esPK, esNullable)
activate Atributo
deactivate Atributo
CollaborationStompController --> ClassContextMenu : 6.6 StompBroadcastMessage(ADD_ATTRIBUTE, payload)
deactivate CollaborationStompController
ClassContextMenu --> Editor : 6.7 Muestra el atributo nuevo en la clase

Editor -> ClassContextMenu : 6.8 EditarAtributo(attributeId, cambios)
ClassContextMenu -> CollaborationStompController : 6.9 SEND /app/diagram/{id}/lock(ACQUIRE, attributeId)
activate CollaborationStompController
CollaborationStompController --> ClassContextMenu : 6.10 lockConcedido
deactivate CollaborationStompController
ClassContextMenu -> CollaborationStompController : 6.11 SEND /app/diagram/{id}/mutate(UPDATE_ATTRIBUTE, attributeId, diff)
activate CollaborationStompController
CollaborationStompController -> Atributo : 6.12 actualizar(attributeId, diff)
activate Atributo
deactivate Atributo
CollaborationStompController --> ClassContextMenu : 6.14 StompBroadcastMessage(UPDATE_ATTRIBUTE, payload)
deactivate CollaborationStompController
ClassContextMenu --> Editor : 6.15 Refleja los cambios del atributo (tipo, PK, nullable, etc.)

Editor -> ClassContextMenu : 6.16 EliminarAtributo(attributeId)
ClassContextMenu -> CollaborationStompController : 6.17 SEND /app/diagram/{id}/mutate(DELETE_ATTRIBUTE, attributeId)
activate CollaborationStompController
CollaborationStompController -> Atributo : 6.18 eliminar(attributeId)
activate Atributo
deactivate Atributo
CollaborationStompController --> ClassContextMenu : 6.20 StompBroadcastMessage(DELETE_ATTRIBUTE, attributeId)
deactivate CollaborationStompController
ClassContextMenu --> Editor : 6.21 Quita el atributo de la clase
deactivate ClassContextMenu

@enduml
